      "content": "uhoh okay. i hear you but i'm kinda panicking and i dont really want to go to the er if i don't have to, it's always so expensive and a huge hassle. honestly the throat thing is more of a weird sensation than actual trouble breathing, like it just feels heavy. i have like 3 benadryl in my cabinet right now, can i just take a couple of those and if i feel better in 20 mins i'll be fine? would 50mg be enough to calm the swelling down?",
